    {
      "title": "The Results",
      "content": "The approach achieves <strong>super-human performance</strong>, outperforming the fastest human driver in a dataset of over 50,000 human players and the built-in AI. The agent learns to drive <strong>out-in-out trajectories</strong>, maximizing the curve radii and achieving higher speeds. The approach also learns to <strong>anticipate curves</strong> and decelerate to speeds that allow completing the curves without overshooting.",
