    {
      "title": "Why It Matters",
      "content": "The approach has implications for <strong>autonomous driving</strong> and <strong>robotics</strong>. The use of deep reinforcement learning and neural network controllers can lead to more efficient and adaptive control systems. The approach also highlights the importance of <strong>robustness and generalization</strong> in autonomous systems, as the agent is able to transfer its learned behavior to new cars and tracks.",
